WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.733
Web3 development didn't disappear when AI arrived.

2
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:06.333
It upgraded.

3
00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:12.667
Before AI, reading a smart contract meant parsing Solidity alone.

4
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:17.833
After AI — plain-English breakdowns, flagged risks, in seconds.

5
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:23.767
Before AI, every contract started from a blank file.

6
00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:28.933
After AI, secure templates generate instantly.

7
00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:34.067
Before AI, learning blockchain meant grinding dense whitepapers.

8
00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:39.233
After AI — interactive explanations, your level, your pace.

9
00:00:39.233 --> 00:00:42.233
Before AI, building solo meant constant walls.

10
00:00:42.233 --> 00:00:46.000
After AI, one developer ships what used to need a full team.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.500
The tools changed. The need to solve problems didn't.

